NPA LeRobot ACT runtime derivative

Upstream project: Hugging Face LeRobot
Upstream revision: 7e241bd630a3719a56157a497ce5d08f244784f1 (v0.6.1)
Upstream license: Apache License 2.0
Derivative version: 0.6.1+npa1

This derivative changes packaging metadata only. It declares the dependency
closure qualified for NPA's RoboCasa ACT evaluation path: PyTorch 2.13,
torchvision 0.28, RoboCasa's Gymnasium 0.29.1 and opencv-python provider, and
setuptools 83. Other LeRobot policies and training paths are not qualified by
this derivative.
